   "integrity_review": "SHY's eight runs of unchanged closes are days on which a fund of one- to three-year Treasuries moved by less than the precision of Yahoo's closes: real. EURCHF's runs from 2012-05-18 and 2012-07-12 are the Swiss National Bank's floor at 1.20 (September 2011 to January 2015), which held the rate still: real. The moves of USDCHF (-16%) and EURCHF (-17%) that Yahoo's series shows on 2015-01-16 are the end of that floor, announced on 15 January 2015: real. EURCHF's three unchanged days from 2010-05-03, which repeat the close of 30 April, and its 17 missing sessions from 2008-08-01 are holes in Yahoo's series: kept as Yahoo gives them, and named here so that an account in francs carries the last close over them."
